        Welcome to [div=display: inline; color: var(--accent-prim); font-weight: bold;]Pokémon Stories[/div], a Choose-Your-Own-Adventure Style RP where the Pokéverse is yours to explore!

       

        [div=margin-top: 15px;]If you can fathom it, we can (probably) accommodate it. Travel across the regions, Earn Badges or Ribbons, Investigate the world's strange and wonderful mysteries, or simply wander the world carving out your own story. Whether you want high-stakes adventure, slice-of-life journeying, or criminal intrigue, there’s space for it here.[/div]

       

        [div=margin-top: 15px;]The catch? Two-fold: one, you've got to write it; two, you've got to remember there are other writers alongside you.[/div]

        [div=margin-top: 15px;]Our setting draws inspiration from every corner of Poké-Media: the Main Series Games, Side Games such as Ranger and Conquest, the Anime, the Manga, and more. [div=display: inline; color: var(--accent-prim); font-weight: bold;]The Games provide the foundation of the world, while other media help fill it out.[/div][/div]

        [div=margin-top: 15px;]This is a Sandbox-Style RP, meaning there is [div=display: inline; color: var(--accent-prim); font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;]no single storyline[/div] you’re required to follow. Instead, the world evolves through events and story-arcs driven directly by you, the Role Player.[/div]

